# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. A shadow import that stages
# on an empty copy instead of a copy of the receiver's own tree loses, at cutover, the
# receiver's own write that has not yet reached its peer, which nothing ships back.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceShadowCopyOpensEmpty
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the shadow copy opens empty, so the cutover drops the receiver's own committed write
PERTURBS: OpenShadow
BOUNDS: Mutual = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ cp' = [cp EXCEPT ![x] = reg[x]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the copy does not carry the receiver's own tree.
    /\ cp' = [cp EXCEPT ![x] = Absent]
--- END